# MF Overhaul 0.4.12: smoke-grenade pass (docs\smoke_grenades.md). c13 slot 1 = fade-in seconds confirmed in game at 0.4.11.
#   smoke_longg (German Nb.Hgr.39 / British grenades, class SMKL): low grey-white wall: 0.8 -> 6 m, settle -0.02, 55 s, 5 s fade-in,
#   keyframes translucent -> opaque -> thinning -> gone; 3 puffs/s for 110 s. New smoke_longgs (Soviet RDG, class SMKS): same puff,
#   3/s for 80 s. New smoke_longgp (smoke pot SMK_MT, class SMPT): 1 -> 9 m, 70 s, 6 s fade-in, 1.2/s for 300 s. Screen volumes
#   (SCR) follow: smk_screeng 0.5 -> 7 m for 110 s, smk_screengs 85 s, smk_screengp 0.5 -> 9 m 60 s each for 305 s.
#   Winter override: smoke_longg / smoke_longgs / smoke_longgp with life 40/40/55 s (cold dry air gives a thin, short cloud).
